  "sketch": "// Slide Switch: pin 1 -> 5V, pin 2 -> D2 with 10kΩ pull-down to GND\n// LED on D13 shows switch state\nconst int switchPin = 2;\nconst int ledPin = 13;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(switchPin, INPUT);\n  pinMode(ledPin, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int state = digitalRead(switchPin);\n  digitalWrite(ledPin, state);\n  Serial.print(\"Switch: \");\n  Serial.println(state ? \"ON\" : \"OFF\");\n  delay(200);\n}\n",
